he SSXT-SSX1 or SSXT-SSX2 fusion proteins"},{"type":"Motif","start":413,"end":416,"description":"SH2-binding"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with MLLT10. Isoform 1 interacts with RBM14 isoform 1. Isoform 2 interacts with RBM14 isoform 1. Component of the multiprotein chromatin-remodeling complexes SWI/SNF: SWI/SNF-A (BAF), SWI/SNF-B (PBAF) and related complexes. The canonical complex contains a catalytic subunit (either SMARCA4/BRG1/BAF190A or SMARCA2/BRM/BAF190B) and at least SMARCE1, ACTL6A/BAF53, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCC2/BAF170, and SMARCB1/SNF5/BAF47. Other subunits specific to each of the complexes may also be present permitting several possible combinations developmentally and tissue specific. Component of the SWI/SNF (GBAF) subcomplex, which includes at least BICRA or BICRAL (mutually exclusive), BRD9, SS18, the core BAF subunits, SMARCA2/BRM, SMARCA4/BRG1/BAF190A, ACTL6A/BAF53, SMARCC1/BAF155, and SMARCD1/BAF60A (PubMed:29374058)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q15532-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":387,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000269137.11"],"refseq":["NM_005637.4"],"refseqProteins":["NP_005628.2"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,294],[295,326,93]],"edits":[{"start":295,"end":325,"original":"HNDYGYQQPSYPEQGYDRPYEDSSQHYYEGG","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":31,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q15532-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q15532-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":54.5,"plddt":[[0,7],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,3],[70,3],[90,45],[70,4],[50,13],[0,2],[50,5],[0,2],[50,3],[0,1],[50,3],[70,1],[50,3],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,3],[50,2],[0,2],[50,7],[0,3],[50,1],[0,1],[50,4],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,4],[0,2],[50,1],[0,13],[50,1],[0,14],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,2],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[0,5],[50,1],[0,10],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[0,3],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,2],